Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:49.20,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}不管跌倒多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:54.15,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}心中坚信一定能抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:10.17,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}始终追寻着那日所见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:15.18,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}可只是一味追赶 却怎么也追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.38,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑战数千回
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:21.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕失败数万次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:25.89,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}几乎要放弃一切时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.70,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}那无法言喻的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.36,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}却在呐喊「还能继续努力」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:36.65,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}于是再次坚定地许下心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:39.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即便如此 也要继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:42.44,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕泪水不再
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:47.71,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}即使一切都是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:50.72,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}能改变此刻的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:53.25,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}唯有自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:03:00.17,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}去超越吧 那曾憧憬的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:59.07,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}遥かその先へ 止まることなく
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:04.10,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}さぁ突き進め 今がその時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.03,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.91,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}思えばこんなにも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.95,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}遠くまで来たもんだな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:22.01,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,300)}身の丈の歩幅で
